# Ritualborn

Make strength a ritual.

Ritualborn is a mobile-friendly workout planner and strength tracker for people starting or returning to strength training. Build a personalized routine around your goals, experience, available equipment, and schedule, then log workouts and track your progress over time.

## Features

- Personalized workout plans shaped by your training goals and experience
- Workout logging for exercises, sets, reps, and weights
- Rest timers to help keep sessions on track
- Strength and body-progress tracking
- Nutrition logging and goals
- An AI coach to help you stay consistent and make informed adjustments
- Installable web app experience on supported devices

## Getting started

Visit [Ritualborn](https://ritualborn.com) and complete the short onboarding quiz to get started.

## Membership

Ritualborn offers a free starter routine and workout logging. Premium adds features such as plan updates, AI coaching, nutrition goals, and expanded history. See the website for current pricing and details.

## Important note

Ritualborn provides general fitness and nutrition information, not medical advice. Choose exercises and goals that suit your abilities, and consult a qualified professional if you have health concerns.

## APK download

The Android APK, if included, is available under **Releases** in this repository. Only install APKs from a source you trust. Android may ask you to allow installation from your browser.

## Privacy

Ritualborn is designed to keep personal progress data private. Review the [Privacy Policy](https://ritualborn.com/privacy) for details.

## Contact

For questions, visit [Ritualborn](https://ritualborn.com/contact).
